{"id":"n67456-1-16","stage":3,"title":"오징어 · 鱿鱼","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67456-1-16-1","ko":"어머, 오징어가 참 싱싱하네요. 얼마예요?","zh":"哎呀，这鱿鱼真新鲜，多少钱？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어머,","meaning":"哎哟，哦","explanation":"어머：哎哟，哦","readings":[{"term":"어머","audio":"/audio/9a1c609712d2db0e30b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30195","senseId":"1","lemma":"어머","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어머","audio":"/audio/9a1c609712d2db0e30b8.mp3"}},{"text":"오징어가","meaning":"鱿鱼","explanation":"오징어：鱿鱼；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"오징어","audio":"/audio/bb6eb188918c6c7346e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67456","senseId":"1","lemma":"오징어","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오징어가","audio":"/audio/3f8abe092554067159a9.mp3"}},{"text":"참","meaning":"真，实在，的确","explanation":"참：真，实在，的确","readings":[{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71761","senseId":"1","lemma":"참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}},{"text":"싱싱하네요.","meaning":"新鲜，鲜活","explanation":"싱싱하다：新鲜，鲜活；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"싱싱하다","audio":"/audio/89f750f70b2054550909.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16474","senseId":"1","lemma":"싱싱하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"싱싱하네요","audio":"/audio/af4e0ab3e49f442514ab.mp3"}},{"text":"얼마예요?","meaning":"多少","explanation":"얼마：多少；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；예요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"얼마","audio":"/audio/8e0a4529e0c9d4ed9058.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29750","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼마예요","audio":"/audio/74f61b058b435e5ecaf9.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9a1c609712d2db0e","term":"어머","zh":"哎哟，哦","audio":"/audio/9a1c609712d2db0e30b8.mp3","entryId":"30195","definition":"主要是女性因没料到的事情感到惊讶或感叹时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["어머"]},{"id":"bb6eb188918c6c73","term":"오징어","zh":"鱿鱼","audio":"/audio/bb6eb188918c6c7346e0.mp3","entryId":"67456","definition":"无骨柔软的长形身体上长有10条腿的，生活在大海的动物。","pronunciation":["오징어"]},{"id":"8e09b5f4c09195e3","term":"참","zh":"真，实在，的确","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3","entryId":"71761","definition":"毫不违背事实或道理，真正地。","pronunciation":["참"]},{"id":"89f750f70b205455","term":"싱싱하다","zh":"新鲜，鲜活","audio":"/audio/89f750f70b2054550909.mp3","entryId":"16474","definition":"不枯萎或不变质，有生气。","pronunciation":["싱싱하다"]},{"id":"8e0a4529e0c9d4ed","term":"얼마","zh":"多少","audio":"/audio/8e0a4529e0c9d4ed9058.mp3","entryId":"29750","definition":"不知道的数量、价值、程度。","pronunciation":["얼마"]}],"audio":"/audio/e05241d72418effe2db0.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67456-1-16-2","ko":"네, 어제 동해 바다에서 바로 잡아 온 거예요. 세 마리에 오천 원이에요.","zh":"是昨天刚从东海捕来的，三只五千韩元。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}},{"text":"동해","meaning":"东海（韩国东侧海域）","explanation":"동해：东海（韩国东侧海域）","readings":[{"term":"동해","audio":"/audio/2ab4c5c9378e2c390976.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"동해","audio":"/audio/2ab4c5c9378e2c390976.mp3"}},{"text":"바다에서","meaning":"海，大海，海洋","explanation":"바다：海，大海，海洋；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"바다","audio":"/audio/1ea5c356f65344cfeb55.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26497","senseId":"1","lemma":"바다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바다에서","audio":"/audio/5925fd490266913fd59a.mp3"}},{"text":"바로","meaning":"就","explanation":"바로：就","readings":[{"term":"바로","audio":"/audio/a441b444c56119c0f154.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64744","senseId":"7","lemma":"바로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바로","audio":"/audio/a441b444c56119c0f154.mp3"}},{"text":"잡아","meaning":"抓，捕","explanation":"잡다：抓，捕；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"잡다","audio":"/audio/b8cc8df3de72c173aa21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70378","senseId":"2","lemma":"잡다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잡아","audio":"/audio/cd01e0912f86aeaeb2e9.mp3"}},{"text":"온","meaning":"来，来到","explanation":"오다：来，来到；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"1","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"온","audio":"/audio/dcc56310451956332238.mp3"}},{"text":"거예요.","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；예요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거예요","audio":"/audio/ce83694d33e9399b0229.mp3"}},{"text":"세","meaning":"三","explanation":"세：三","readings":[{"term":"세","audio":"/audio/1bcc05bddb3c9e8c0bec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17194","senseId":"1","lemma":"세","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"세","audio":"/audio/1bcc05bddb3c9e8c0bec.mp3"}},{"text":"마리에","meaning":"只，头，条","explanation":"마리：只，头，条；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"마리","audio":"/audio/1338676ef4cf144fb5fa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"51771","senseId":"1","lemma":"마리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마리에","audio":"/audio/9cea1a995b7c7a16d047.mp3"}},{"text":"오천","meaning":"5000（汉字数词）","explanation":"오천：5000（汉字数词）","readings":[{"term":"오천","audio":"/audio/db8fc547a104d0568f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오천","audio":"/audio/db8fc547a104d0568f0e.mp3"}},{"text":"원이에요.","meaning":"韩元，韩币","explanation":"원：韩元，韩币；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"원","audio":"/audio/c19fd6787279897c79a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27771","senseId":"1","lemma":"원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"원이에요","audio":"/audio/a2d3688fc280746c4ad7.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"1ea5c356f65344cf","term":"바다","zh":"海，大海，海洋","audio":"/audio/1ea5c356f65344cfeb55.mp3","entryId":"26497","definition":"在地球上除陆地以外被咸水填满的部分。","pronunciation":["바다"]},{"id":"a441b444c56119c0","term":"바로","zh":"就","audio":"/audio/a441b444c56119c0f154.mp3","entryId":"64744","definition":"时间上或空间上非常近地。","pronunciation":["바로"]},{"id":"b8cc8df3de72c173","term":"잡다","zh":"抓，捕","audio":"/audio/b8cc8df3de72c173aa21.mp3","entryId":"70378","definition":"捉住放在手里。","pronunciation":["잡따"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"从别的地方移动到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"1bcc05bddb3c9e8c","term":"세","zh":"三","audio":"/audio/1bcc05bddb3c9e8c0bec.mp3","entryId":"17194","definition":"三个的。","pronunciation":["세ː"]},{"id":"1338676ef4cf144f","term":"마리","zh":"只，头，条","audio":"/audio/1338676ef4cf144fb5fa.mp3","entryId":"51771","definition":"计算飞禽走兽或鱼虫等的数量单位。","pronunciation":["마리"]},{"id":"c19fd6787279897c","term":"원","zh":"韩元，韩币","audio":"/a